WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.331 --> 00:00:09.792
In this walkthrough, we are going to add and edit widgets. Add a widget to a slot and open its configuration.

2
00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:12.099
This is useful because it shows the path through the admin interface before you need to do the same task on real content.

3
00:00:12.099 --> 00:00:13.814
Start in All Slots on the page editor, because widgets are added inside page slots.

4
00:00:13.814 --> 00:00:14.465
Confirm that the editor has opened the page you want to change.

5
00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:16.990
Expand the Main Content slot so its widget controls are visible.

6
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.850
Click the plus icon on the Main Content slot where the new widget should appear.

7
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.928
Choose Image widget from the widget picker.

8
00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:27.303
Click the settings icon on the new widget row to open its configuration panel.

9
00:00:27.303 --> 00:00:29.033
The right panel is where you configure the widget before saving the page.

10
00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.356
By the end, you should know where to start, what to click, and what to check before you save or publish your work.
